class: negative
summary: the text compiler.utf8_unvalidated gives is read-only utf8, so it is no writable byte view, and only a byte view becomes text
constructs: 0430, 0570, 0600, 1120, 1560
program: program.ldn
codes: L0301, L0301
expect: expected.txt
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/utf8-unvalidated-is-read-only/program.ldn
